1. Data file (algorithmSteps.js)

Export initialArray and target
Export STEPS — an IIFE that runs the algorithm and captures each state as { ...pointers/indices, sum, action }
Export getExplanation(action) — returns a string for each action type

2. Page component (AlgorithmPage.jsx)

Import steps data
State: step, any mode switchers
Derive current = STEPS[step]
Derive display values: explanation, statusMsg, progressPct
Controls: reset, goNext, goPrev
JSX structure:

Header + progress bar
Array wrap (map over array, classify each cell)
Explanation card
Status pill
Controls (prev/next/reset)
Step info footer



3. CSS (algorithm.css)

Cell states (default, active, found)
Explanation card variants per action
Status pill variants per action
Progress bar
Controls + buttons

